#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:38
msgid ""
"In prior versions, we could set Limits when creating a Subtenant. These "
"could restrict the amount of storage, memory, and CPUs that can be "
"collectively provisioned by all users in the Tenant. In more recent "
"versions, this functionality has been rolled into Policies (|AdmPol|). "
"When creating a Policy, we are able to specify a Tenant to which the "
"Policy should apply."
msgstr ""
"En prior versions, we could establecido Limits cuando creando a "
"Subinquilino. Estos could restringir el amount de storage, memory, y CPUs"
" ese puede ser collectively provisioned por todos usuarios en el "
"Inquilino. En más recent versions, este functionality ha sido rolled en "
"Políticas (|AdmPol|). Cuando creando a Política, we son able a "
"especificar a Inquilino a que el Política debería aplicar."

