"Resources in the Master Tenant can also be assigned directly to "
"Subtenants. When a resource is assigned to a Subtenant, it is only "
"available for that Subtenant, and its visibility is automatically set to "
"private. Public visibility is not an option for any resource assigned to "
"or created in a Subtenant."
