"configuración no puede ser edited desde Subinquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:136
msgid "Assign a Cloud to an Tenant"
msgstr "Assign a Nube a un Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:138
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:138
msgid ""
"When assigning a Cloud to a Tenant, all resources for that Cloud will "
"only be available to the assigned Tenant. If a cloud is created in the "
"Master Tenant and assigned to a sub-Tenant, it will no longer be "
"available for use by the Master Tenant or any other sub-Tenants, although"
" it can be assigned back to the Master Tenant, or to another sub-Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Cuando assigning a Nube a a Inquilino, todos recursos para ese Nube va a "
"solo be disponible a el asignado Inquilino. Si a cloud es creado en el "
"Inquilino maestro y asignado a a sub-Inquilino, ello va a no longer be "
"disponible para usar por el Inquilino maestro o cualquier otro sub-"
"Inquilinos, although ello puede ser asignado back a el Inquilino maestro,"
" o a another sub-Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:140
msgid ""
"It may be preferable for service providers to share or assign their cloud"
" resources, such as specific hosts, networks, resources pools and "
"datastores, across sub-Tenants, rather than an entire cloud."
msgstr ""
"It puede be preferable para service providers a share o assign su cloud "
"recursos, como específico hosts, redes, recursos pools y datastores, a "
"través de sub-Inquilinos, rather than un completo cloud."

